{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"平\",\n    \"human\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：X 的大块直接交代人物动机、当下反应和前后转折，单看大字更容易理解每屏发生了什么，并串起全曲；Y 的高亮词虽然抓重点，但有些关系和原因仍要靠小字恢复。small：Y 的小字更顺着叙事补充因果和具体处境，读起来比较连贯；X 的部分感受句与大字表达的意思有所重叠。core：两版都完整保留了亲密的幸福与留不住它的痛楚交织的主线，没有明显偏离。concise：两版都有局部近义复沓，X 有大字与感受重复，Y 在互相需要、自我接纳等处也有重复，整体差距不大。human：Y 的日常口语感更好，X 的“安静相处的满足”“坦露在乎”“相互愿意”“拿捏相处分寸”偏抽象、书面化。fine：X 的感受更持续落在具体的身体反应和关系体验上，例如话到嘴边的迟疑、白天亲近而夜里独处的酸楚、想抱牢当下又怕破坏平衡；Y 有些感受转去描写歌声、声部和音符本身。load：Y 的高亮短语虽然数量较多，但每块短小，X 的大字块明显更长，例如 S05 只有 18 秒却要扫三块，S11 也有四块较长文字，整体阅读压力更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4c91e21a-3518-4bd1-87ee-b797e149f687", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T195712862115Z", "elapsed_seconds": 449.468, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:04:42.339349+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a0e7021c019e7046295ab291c6d777bf992c5057315207d42f541489e6aef8fb", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha